---
/*
 * Decorative hero background: a note burning away from its right edge.
 * Drawn from the Canva concept "B2" (burning note) as inline SVG so it stays
 * a few KB, sharp at any size, and themed per color scheme. Opt in per page
 * with `heroBackground: burn` in frontmatter; see Hero.astro.
 *
 * Purely decorative: aria-hidden, no pointer events, and the ember drift
 * stops under prefers-reduced-motion.
 */
